{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10211015","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10211015","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1021101501:1":{"text":"Oh, Melissa! You're here just in time.\nCome meet my new friends—","source_cn":"是梅丽莎，你来的正是时候。\\n给你介绍下我的新朋友——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86073247212D85D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1021101502:1":{"text":"I don't care about your new \"friends\"! They could've eaten you! Do you have any idea how worried I was?!","source_cn":"别再提什么朋友了，你知不知道刚才我在担心你被吃掉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5776B9F7114B4CD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1021101503:1":{"text":"Eat me? Ha! No way! I used the book \"Grug Lingo\" to help me communicate. It's our ticket into the gruglin world!","source_cn":"吃掉？哈，那怎么可能？我已经按照《咕布林用语指南》和他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48B5658E99BFAAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1021101504:1":{"text":"Gali, that book was never peer-reviewed or substantiated!","source_cn":"伽利，那本教材自从发行之后就没被修订过！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E3B2B1EA5EE168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1021101505:1":{"text":"Don't be biased against a book. The gods give us wisdom when we need it most. Especially in this case, I believe Gruglins are far more intelligent than we were led to believe.","source_cn":"怎么能对我们的教材有偏见呢？\\n没有神的指引，智慧绝不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD391361DC974FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1021101506:1":{"text":"Let me show you. ","source_cn":"我现在就演示给你看，你一定会大吃一惊的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48AE693CD9A7BD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1021101507:1":{"text":"Grug grug gu? Glu?","source_cn":"咕咕叽叽？叽叽咕咕？叽叽~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B70DE8144809EC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1021101508:1":{"text":"Grug gu ka! Grug gu ka!","source_cn":"咕咕嘎嘎！咕咕嘎嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x268B4D522CD1BA7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1021101509:1":{"text":"I see. I think he's saying that the shade here makes this place the best spot to relax.","source_cn":"原来如此，原来如此，他觉得此地绿荫遮蔽，是个休憩的好地点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD09000C8C2ECCB5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1021101510:1":{"text":"Uh... Then, why is he swinging his stick around like a maniac? Are you sure he understood you?","source_cn":"呃……那他为什么在挥舞棍子？你确定他听懂了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5DEC2686AA682E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1021101511:1":{"text":"He's just excited that we both understand each other.","source_cn":"那是说到兴起而自然流露的身体动作，足以证明我和他建立了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BD5252F2D96C7A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1021101512:1":{"text":"Next, I'll ask him where the ruins are.","source_cn":"接下来，让我问问遗迹的所在地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC06265835EA8928","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1021101513:1":{"text":"Baba ka! Grug gu ka?","source_cn":"叽叽！咕咕嘎叽叽？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6162605325BB5A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1021101514:1":{"text":"Baba grug? Grug ka! Grug ka!","source_cn":"咕咕嘎嘎？嘎嘎呜呜呜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x451F7726785F6414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1021101515:1":{"text":"Ka! Ka! Ka!","source_cn":